## Purpose

This document defines the ETCS/RBC supervisory layer responsible for operational control and monitoring of Radio Block Centre (RBC) areas operating within ERTMS/ETCS infrastructure.

The supervisory layer provides a unified interface for:

- ETCS session supervision,
- Movement Authority (MA) management,
- train positioning,
- train deregistration,
- emergency train stop handling,
- RBC operational commands,
- DSAT alarm supervision,
- operator authorization handling,
- transmission of ETCS text messages.

The system decouples operational supervision from a specific RBC implementation.  
Different RBC implementations may be integrated through a common supervisory interface without modifications to the engine core.

